{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266JpJ7RMgBi1795841050.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>俄羅斯新型核潛艇「彼爾姆」號入列，是俄軍第一艘常態化裝備「鋯石」高超音速導彈的多用途潛艇，將加入太平洋艦隊服役。</p><p></p><p>俄羅斯總統普京周五出席在西北部北德文斯克「彼爾姆」號的入列儀式。「彼爾姆」號屬於俄羅斯第四代「亞森-M」級核潛艇。官兵在潛艇上升起俄羅斯海軍旗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RUS.SUBMARINE 1200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CeZ6DZWs9p1795841117.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>普京表示，「彼爾姆」號已是俄軍六年來接收的第五艘「亞森-M」級潛艇。他形容這類核潛艇具備全球戰略意義，強調俄羅斯是世上少數有能力建造先進核潛艇的國家，並將繼續推進水下軍力建設。到2030年前，俄軍還會接收多五艘核潛艇。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:34:10.329149+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:14.748616+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:27:21.152377+00:00","content_hash":"7a15395c7f398af21dd12a1104cc2eeb76528768df04a1d0f0bc583b8eecb9aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}